   1550 ! CALCULATE THE ESTIMATED OUTFLOW TEMPERATURE AT HIGHER PORTS WHEN TCOMP<TCTEMP(J), AND MOVE UP IF HIGHER PORT STILL MEETS T
   1550 O CRITERIA
   1551                    I         = MAX(CUS(JBWD(JWD)),IWD(JWD))
